{
  "title": "Claim Your Territory",
  "description": "Claim your exclusive ZIP territory One licensed MLO per ZIP. Tell us which ZIP you want and we\u2019ll confirm availability and get you started \u2014 free to start, no\u2026",
  "beforeHtml": "<div id=\"ypn-claim\">\n<style>\n#ypn-claim{--bg:#F7F7F4;--surface:#FFFFFF;--ink:#10182B;--navy:#0A1F44;--accent:#9C7A1F;--muted:#5B6472;--border:#E4E2DB;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}\n#ypn-claim *{box-sizing:border-box}\n#ypn-claim .wrap{width:min(760px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto;padding:72px 0}\n#ypn-claim h1{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);line-height:1.1;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 16px}\n#ypn-claim p.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 28px}\n#ypn-claim .founder{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 32px}\n#ypn-claim .founder img{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n#ypn-claim .founder p{margin:0;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\n#ypn-claim .founder strong{color:var(--ink)}\n#ypn-claim .panel{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:36px}\n#ypn-claim .wpforms-field-label{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n#ypn-claim .wpforms-field input,#ypn-claim .wpforms-field textarea{border:1px solid var(--border)!important;border-radius:8px!important;background:var(--bg)!important;color:var(--ink)!important}\n#ypn-claim .wpforms-submit{background:var(--navy)!important;border-radius:8px!important;border:none!important;font-weight:600!important}\n#ypn-claim .trust-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:18px;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\n#ypn-claim .trust-row span::before{content:'\u2713 ';color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}\n#ypn-claim .next-steps{margin-top:40px;max-width:560px}\n#ypn-claim .next-steps h2{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 10px}\n#ypn-claim .next-steps ol{margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.7}\n#ypn-claim .alt-paths{margin-top:28px;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}\n#ypn-claim .alt-paths a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}\n#ypn-claim .alt-paths a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n#ypn-claim .compliance-footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:0.76rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;line-height:1.6}\n#ypn-claim .compliance-footer a{color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h1>Claim your exclusive ZIP territory</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">One licensed MLO per ZIP. Tell us which ZIP you want and we&#8217;ll confirm availability and get you started \u2014 free to start, no credit card.</p>\n<div class=\"founder\">\n<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ypnus-davidjmoore.jpg\" alt=\"David Moore\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>David Moore, MBA</strong> \u00b7 25-year loan officer \u00b7 NMLS #787257<br />Territory is first-come, first-served \u2014 once your ZIP is claimed, no other YPN USA loan officer can take it from you.</p>\n</div>\n",
  "afterHtml": "</div>\n<div class=\"trust-row\"><span>No credit card</span><span>Cancel anytime</span><span>One LO per ZIP</span></div>\n<div class=\"next-steps\">\n<h2>What happens after you submit</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>We confirm your ZIP is still open (most are \u2014 territory locks only after you&#8217;re on a paid plan).</li>\n<li>You get a free borrower page and ZIP access right away.</li>\n<li>Lock the ZIP whenever you&#8217;re ready by choosing a plan \u2014 Growth, Pro, or Elite.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p class=\"alt-paths\">Haven&#8217;t seen the numbers for your ZIP yet? <a href=\"/check-zip.html\">Check your 60-day demand report free \u2192</a><br />Ready to lock your ZIP today? <a href=\"/pricing.html\">See plans &amp; pricing \u2192</a></p>\n<p class=\"compliance-footer\">YPN INC &middot; NMLS #787257 &middot; Equal Housing Opportunity &middot; <a href=\"https://www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org/EntityDetails.aspx/individual/787257\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">NMLS Consumer Access</a> &middot; Not a commitment to lend. You remain responsible for RESPA, TCPA, and state licensing compliance.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><script>\n(function(){\n  var m = /[?&]zip=([0-9]{5})/.exec(window.location.search);\n  if (!m) return;\n  var zip = m[1];\n  var tries = 0;\n  var timer = setInterval(function(){\n    var el = document.querySelector('input[name=\"wpforms[fields][4]\"]');\n    if (el) { el.value = zip; clearInterval(timer); }\n    if (++tries > 30) clearInterval(timer);\n  }, 150);\n})();\n</script></p>\n"
}